      "content": "Here are some behavioral indicators, or \"red flags,\" that may suggest a potential threat in a high-density urban environment: Lose of confidence or перестellation (i.e., sideways or chaotic rearrangement) of themselves. Aggressive tone, stuttering or repetitive speech, stacking words or silences. Viewing their surroundings for any possible escape routes. Not cooperating or politely evasive when asked to identify themselves or stay put. Displaying advanced avoidant behaviors.",
